    title: "People escape historic Kyiv building hit by Russian drone",
    summary: "The BBC's Paul Adams reports from the scene of the strike on Ukraine's National Academy of Sciences.",
    preview: "Ukraine's National Academy of Sciences has been hit by a Russian drone strike, killing one person and leaving three injured, according to city's mayor Vitaliy Klitschko. Footage showed people leaning out of windows as they evacuated the burning building. Firefighters helped people evacuate through the windows as a plume a black smoke billowed out of the building. The BBC's diplomatic correspondent Paul Adams was at the scene as emergency services attempted to stop the raging fire.",
    body: "Ukraine's National Academy of Sciences has been hit by a Russian drone strike, killing one person and leaving three injured, according to city's mayor Vitaliy Klitschko.\n\nFootage showed people leaning out of windows as they evacuated the burning building.\n\nFirefighters helped people evacuate through the windows as a plume a black smoke billowed out of the building.\n\nThe BBC's diplomatic correspondent Paul Adams was at the scene as emergency services attempted to stop the raging fire.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- RussiaUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- War in UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- KyivUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
